<title>JAPAN: Osaki Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Osaki Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.29		vs	   10.38</p>
<p> Operating	  750    million    vs	  521    million</p>
<p> Current	    735    million    vs	  566    million</p>
<p> Net		  380    million    vs	  269    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.04 yen	  vs	    7.24 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     39 million	  vs	  37 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Osaki Electric Co Ltd manufactures watthour meters for electric power companies.</p>
</text>
